      "endMs": 19378,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 1
    }
  ],
  "TW32": [
    {
      "text": "只排序组身份，不移动整组成员；精确斜率提供一致次序。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 6238,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "采用具有最坏情况下对数乘线性保证的比较排序。",
      "startMs": 6689,
      "endMs": 10849,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "每次 h_p≤n，所以累计排序成本不超过 H 乘以对数。",
