      "endMs": 9747,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "不能只数最后成功新增的位置。",
      "startMs": 10038,
      "endMs": 12370,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 1
    }
  ],
  "TW36": [
    {
      "text": "由事件数界和输入对数上界，可得 E+1≤(n+1)^2。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 6908,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "所以队列的一次对数操作成本，也受 log(n+1) 的常数倍控制。",
      "startMs": 7380,
      "endMs": 13665,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 1
    }
  ],
  "TW37": [
    {
      "text": "初始化至多 2n 次端点登记，之后计入全部预约尝试和 E 次弹出。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 7087,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "覆盖读取也收费，合计仍是 O((n+k) log(n+1))。",
