      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 5538,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null,
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "因此普通求交总计 O((n+k) log(n+1)) 次精确算术、比较及基本状态操作。",
